    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "1F919732251A207B",
      "text": "¿Quieres enfrentarte a la Líder de Gimnasio Tuli,\\nla Maquilladora Mágica?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "1F919832251A222E",
      "text": "Muy bien, permíteme acompañarte a la arena de\\ncombate.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "1F919932251A23E1",
      "text": "Avísame cuando estés list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, no hay prisa.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_01",
      "hash64": "EA01E71F5103C776",
      "text": "Sí, tienes razón... Vale, yo me encargo de todo,\\nno te preocupes.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_02",
      "hash64": "EA01E61F5103C5C3",
      "text": "Prefiero que el eslogan sea algo más sencillo.\\n\"Belleza al natural\", por ejemplo.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_03",
      "hash64": "EA01E51F5103C410",
      "text": "¿A que sí? Y si puedes ir encargando el nuevo\\ntono de sombra de ojos, me harías un favorazo.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_04",
      "hash64": "EA01EC1F5103CFF5",
      "text": "Gracias, te debo una. Hablamos luego, ¿vale?\\nMe están esperando.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_01",
      "hash64": "A1A3806506F21EE3",
      "text": "¡Hola, cariño![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_02",
      "hash64": "A1A3816506F22096",
      "text": "¡Encantada! Soy Tuli, la líder de este gimnasio.\\c\\nBueno, esto es algo que hago en mi tiempo libre.\\nEn realidad, soy maquilladora profesional.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_03",
      "hash64": "A1A3826506F22249",
      "text": "Kendrita me ha hablado muy bien de ti, ¿sabes?\\nDice que eres \"un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a máquina\".[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_04",
      "hash64": "A1A3836506F223FC",
      "text": "Pero se le ha olvidado mencionar lo mon[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa que\\neres, querid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa aspirante. Ji, ji, ji...[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_05",
      "hash64": "A1A3846506F225AF",
      "text": "¿Será que el ejercicio, diseñado especialmente\\npor moi, ha sacado a relucir tu belleza interior?\\r\\n¡Porque estás radiante![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_06",
      "hash64": "A1A3856506F22762",
      "text": "Y veo que también sabes mantener acicalado[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s a\\ntu[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s Pokémon. Tienes buen ojo para la estética.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
