    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_07",
      "hash64": "A1A3866506F22915",
      "text": "Las personas debemos cuidar no solo nuestra\\nimagen, sino también la de nuestros Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_08",
      "hash64": "A1A3876506F22AC8",
      "text": "Los cosméticos pueden transformar a cualquiera.\\nMáscara de pestañas, algo de colorete y voilà...\\r\\n¡El maquillaje es pura magia![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_09",
      "hash64": "A1A3886506F22C7B",
      "text": "Voy a dejar a tu[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s Pokémoncito[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s más guapo[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s que\\nnunca, ¡ya lo verás![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
