        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_10",
      "hash64": "A1A7056506F536B9",
      "text": "Has ganado el combate... y tu belleza ha estado\\na la altura de la mía... ¿Quién lo habría pensado?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_11",
      "hash64": "A1A7046506F53506",
      "text": "¡Eres increíble, cariño! ¡Has estado divin[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_12",
      "hash64": "A1A7036506F53353",
      "text": "Me encantaría convertirte en mi protegid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa antes\\nde que logres dar el salto al estrellato algún día.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_13",
      "hash64": "A1A7026506F531A0",
      "text": "Aunque, por el momento, debería centrarme en\\nseguir mejorándome a mí misma, y a nadie más.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_14",
      "hash64": "A1A7096506F53D85",
      "text": "¡Enhorabuena! Aquí tienes tu Medalla de\\nGimnasio, acompañada de mi mejor pose.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_badge",
      "hash64": "4A010119989BC04B",
      "text": "Ahora que tienes [VAR 0x0200(0001)] medalla[VAR 0x1101(0001,0100)]s, podrás capturar\\nmás fácilmente a los Pokémon de hasta Nv. [VAR 0x0201(0002)]\\r\\ny harán todo lo que les pidas, ¡sin rechistar![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
