    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_waza",
      "hash64": "799E8E5F8222D3D9",
      "text": "Un truquito para dominar este movimiento es...\\n¡trabajar a fondo los abdominales![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_17",
      "hash64": "A1A7066506F5386C",
      "text": "Ah, y que ni se te ocurra colgar nuestra foto de\\nrecuerdo en tus redes sociales, ¿lo prometes?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_15",
      "hash64": "A1A7086506F53BD2",
      "text": "¡Mírame! He sudado tanto durante el combate\\nque se me ha corrido un pelín el maquillaje...[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_16",
      "hash64": "A1A7076506F53A1F",
      "text": "Siento tener que dejarte aquí colgad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, cariño,\\n¡pero mi piel pide a gritos unos retoques antes\\r\\nde mi próxima cita!\\c\\nYa hablamos otro día, ¿vale?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
